   "agent_notes": [
    "'He lodged there that night' (32:14) and 'took of what came to his hand' are read as the same evening: the selection happens in the evening after the prayer, snapped to EREV. The text could mean the gift was chosen the next morning; I rejected it because 32:22 has the gift crossing before him and Jacob lodging that same night."
