  "event:evt.gen_32.jacob_prays": {
   "status": "approved",
   "produced_by": {
    "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
    "skill": "urim-chronologist@5",
    "run": "main"
   },
   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T14:10:56+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "Jacob quotes God's earlier words (31:3 'return to your land', and the promise of 'good' and seed like the sand, cf. 28:14, 31:13); the fulfilment of the offspring promise lies beyond this chapter, so no link is written here. The new name Israel (32:29) is confirmed by God at Bethel in Gen 35:10; that chapter's session should write the link."
   ],
   "history": [
    {
     "status": "approved",
     "at": "2026-11-02T14:12:14+00:00",
