   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T14:10:56+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "The text gives no duration. Mahanaim to Edom is about 200 km by road, ~4 days at 'hurry' (urim travel). Esau is already marching north with 400 men (32:7), so the messengers meet him sooner than the full distance; I took 6 days for the round trip with a 3-day margin. Seir/Edom's exact location is uncertain (loc.seir confidence 0.775), which would change this."
   ],
