    "run": "main"
   },
   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T14:10:56+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "The sun rises 'as he passed Penuel' (32:32). It follows the naming at once and is placed at sunrise (BOKER) on the same morning, so the whole wrestling night is one Hebrew night with the day beginning at EREV the evening before."
   ],
