    "run": "main"
   },
   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T14:10:56+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "'Until the coming up of dawn' (32:25), so the wrestling ends at dawn. I fix its start after the crossing and give it 3 hours; the pre-dawn hours are an estimate, not a text figure, hence DAY_SEQUENCE."
   ],
   "history": [
    {
     "status": "approved",
     "at": "2026-11-02T14:12:14+00:00",
     "note": "[consider] Make the wrestling end at dawn (e.g. a 3.5 h duration, or a start chosen so its END meets SHACHAR) so the blessing follows it with no gap. (GEN.32.25: \"there wrestled a man with him until the coming up of the dawn\"; GEN.32.27: \"Let me go, for the dawn has come up\")",
     "by": "urim-critic@3 · claude-opus-5-5"
    }
   ],
